{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670915245922208053","title":"光学设计工程师 - PICO","description":"团队介绍：作为一家拥有自主创新和研发创造能力的科技品牌，PICO致力于成为领先的世界级XR平台，成就开发者与创作者，共同为全球消费者创造更美好的生活体验。我们开创性地将虚拟现实扩展到了多个领域，为运动、视频、娱乐等消费级场景带来了全新体验；并广泛应用在教育、医疗和企业培训等商用场景，给全球企业级用户提供了多元化的VR解决方案。\n\n1、探索微纳光学结构和系统在AR/VR显示中的应用；\n2、光学模拟与仿真显示系统中的关键光学元件与模组；\n3、开发AR/VR显示系统的光学仿真算法与平台。","requirement":"1、2027届获得硕士及以上学位，物理、光学、电子科学专业优先；\n2、在衍射光学、微纳结构光学和计算电磁学等领域有研究经历和背景；有较强的编程能力，熟悉Python、MATLAB等编程语言；熟练使用Virtual Lab，LightTools、Code V、Zemax等仿真软件；\n3、熟悉近眼显示光学系统的设计、仿真、搭建或者元器件制造。","job_category":{"id":"6938376045242353957","name":"硬件","en_name":"Hardware","i18n_name":"硬件","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"6704215862603155720","name":"研发","en_name":"R\u0026D","i18n_name":"研发","depth":1,"children":[]},"children":[]},"city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786024306275,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7649336829398468869","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘","i18n":"2027届校园招聘"},"active_status":1},"code":"A94676","job_id":"7670914906452199733","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"上海","py_name":"shanghai","mdm_code":"MDCY00000002","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"a